4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Focus charged energy and strike an enemy for %d%% weapon damage as lightning.\n\t\tEnergy will then discharge from your weapon, doing an extra %0.2f lightning damage and halving their stun/daze/freeze/pin resistance for %d turns.\n\t\tIf the target is pinned and Charged Shield is sustained, its absorb value will be increased by %0.2f.\n\t\tIf the target is frozen, the ice will melt in a flash of vapour, knocking back all creatures around it in radius 2.\n\t\tThe discharge damage will scale with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"聚集电能，以闪电伤害打击敌人，造成 %d%% 武器伤害。\n\t\t随后，能量会从你的武器中释放，额外造成 %0.2f 点闪电伤害，并使其震慑/眩晕/冰冻/定身抗性减半，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t若目标被定身且电能护盾处于持续状态，其吸收值将提高 %0.2f 点。\n\t\t若目标被冻结，冰块会在蒸汽中瞬间融化，将其周围半径 2 格内的所有生物击退。\n\t\t释放伤害受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0a6e273c514483864b3678fb5887986f25d7511c97b718d261bc7ca84b7084c0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d8933a6a86bc717a46106ba80196064f00c21d14a472e4b65922fb401e5a6150","logical_entry_identity":"7cff6a8131d930cb9601f344495e4a195964632c4d9e38f0cb797960f23a0cae","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Urkis, the High Tempest","source_tag":"entity name","target":"风暴魔导师厄奇斯"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4f4934ffd36afac7cbd38f9aa0a15f51e8fe643d0259cc859b284b3f4e594c63","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d897addf74c78782af6d80ad191e262fc71728ab14a7c9bf9b154cff94e195c8","logical_entry_identity":"d16c29baa60c52e0fa71dac409c153a7bbb29192780ecc6bb6c4d28e4c0ee148","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"pair of blackened boots","source_tag":"_t","target":"一双熏黑的靴子"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"40635bea8333e2b9373c293a5746b6da33ac4acfabf325ed64915ec0d0bf5b0f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d89937c4ffd5e43c208b7bae6d9b08f0eb50af3d4363fb210892d4430a4518ba","logical_entry_identity":"6cf4e5ae0cdee586e635afe532530ba2edd3986f2d559338f75543cf207ffe5f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Phase shift yourself for 